1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,569
Five things you must never do in Tuvalu.

2
00:00:02,849 --> 00:00:05,226
The last one surprises everyone.

3
00:00:05,506 --> 00:00:08,056
1. Don't swim in the Funafuti lagoon.

4
00:00:08,086 --> 00:00:12,657
The British and American governments
both call it highly polluted.

5
00:00:12,937 --> 00:00:15,441
2. Don't arrive without an onward ticket.

6
00:00:15,471 --> 00:00:20,201
Immigration asks for proof that you are
leaving, or you can be refused entry.

7
00:00:20,481 --> 00:00:23,437
3. Don't dress revealingly
away from the beach.

8
00:00:23,467 --> 00:00:28,456
It is a tight-knit Christian society,
and visitors are asked to dress modestly.

9
00:00:28,736 --> 00:00:32,514
4. Don't be loud on Sunday. It
is a day of church and rest,

10
00:00:32,544 --> 00:00:35,095
and visitors are asked to stay discreet.

11
00:00:35,375 --> 00:00:39,717
5. Don't wander onto the runway on
a flight day. There is no fence,

12
00:00:39,747 --> 00:00:42,196
and the airport is also the town park.

